/*!
\page page_stFmsHit StFmsHit

\brief Raw tower hit in the STAR Forward Meson Spectrometer (FMS).

\section fmsHit_overview Overview

StFmsHit stores the raw ADC/TDC readout and calibrated energy for a single
lead-glass tower channel in the STAR FMS (2.5 < η < 4.0).  The FMS has four
sub-detectors: NorthLarge (ID=8), SouthLarge (ID=9), NorthSmall (ID=10),
SouthSmall (ID=11).  The readout uses QT (charge-integrating ADC) boards;
the packed word \c mQTCrtSlotCh encodes crate, slot, and channel.

\section fmsHit_hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\code
TObject → StObject → StFmsHit
\endcode

Stored in \ref page_stFmsCollection "StFmsCollection".

\section fmsHit_members Data Members

| Type | Name | Description |
|---|---|---|
| UShort_t | mDetectorId | Sub-detector ID: 8=NLarge, 9=SLarge, 10=NSmall, 11=SSmall. |
| UShort_t | mChannel | Tower channel number within the detector (0-based). |
| UShort_t | mQTCrtSlotCh | Packed QT address: bits15-12=crate, bits11-8=slot, bits7-0=channel. |
| UShort_t | mAdc | Raw ADC count. |
| UShort_t | mTdc | TDC value. |
| Float_t | mEnergy | Calibrated energy [GeV]. |

\section fmsHit_methods Key Methods

- \c detectorId() — sub-detector ID (8–11).
- \c channel() — tower channel.
- \c qtCrate(), \c qtSlot(), \c qtChannel() — QT board address.
- \c adc() — raw ADC count.
- \c tdc() — TDC value.
- \c energy() — calibrated energy [GeV].
- \c setFmsHit() — set all fields at once.
- \c print() — print summary.

\section fmsHit_seealso See Also

\ref page_stFmsCluster "StFmsCluster",
\ref page_stFmsPoint "StFmsPoint"
*/
